# Ice Path Hollow 1F -- the river floor under the Hollow, 16x18 (buffer 528/1300)
# BUILT on branch 88-ice-path-hollow (maps/IcePathHollow1F.asm). TILESET_ICE_PATH, CAVE, LANDMARK_ICE_PATH.
# shasocastris redrew the river by hand 2026-11-11; the grid and objects below are generated FROM the
#   built map (../from_build.py), not the other way round.
# The player arrives surfing from Blackthorn's cave mouth (johto a9/aa; this map's 4c/4d mirror them,
#   warps at 7,32 and 8,32).
# RIVER, mouth to source, two blocks wide: mouth (blocks 3-4,16) -> north (cols 3-4, rows 12-15) ->
#   steps north-east (rows 9-11) to cols 8-9 -> climbable waterfall 52/53 (8-9,7) -> upper level,
#   widening east (rows 3-5) -> the spring, wall fall 4e/4f (10-11,1), which the player cannot follow.
# The waterfall is the only way to the upper level; the ladder to 2F (block 13,2, warp 27,5) is up there.
# Ice sheets: upper north-west (blocks 2-4, rows 3-4) and lower middle (cols 7-11, rows 12-13).
# PEOPLE: the ones who never got up the falls, or stopped just above them (L49-51).
#   Swimmer Lars in the river at 17,20 (Dewgong / Poliwrath; SPRITE_SWIMMER_GUY, not a variable sprite);
#   Skier Greta at 24,27 east of the lower ice sheet (Jynx / Cloyster);
#   Boarder Nils at 5,18 on the west bank below the wall (Piloswine / Dewgong / Sneasel);
#   Firebreather Knut at 15,10 on the upper west bank, facing the water (Magmar / Houndoom).
# ITEMS: BIG PEARL 11,26 on the east bank above the mouth, MAX ELIXER 2,5 in the upper north-west
#   corner, hidden STAR PIECE 29,28 in the south-east corner. Wild Pokemon on land and water.
# SOURCE: the built map. python3 ../from_build.py IcePathHollow1F 16 f1 ice_path_hollow_1f (run from
#   icepath/) rewrites this file. The old sketch is in ../superseded/f1/. Do NOT copy the .ablk
#   written here back over maps/ unless shasocastris asks for a design change.
# CHECK: ../amap_ice.py and ../river.py on the .amap
tileset ice_path
ref IcePath1F
key .=02 6=03 #=19 i=1f b=20 3=21 h=22 2=23 7=2d g=2e f=2f a=40
key 5=42 4=43 e=45 8=47 j=4c k=4d 0=4e 1=4f 9=51 c=52 d=53
